Subject: [PATCH v4 21/21] gstreamer1.0-plugins-good: on wayland qt5 needs qtwayland
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2020 19:41:32 +0100
Message-Id: <20201023184132.3208737-22-quaresma.jose@gmail.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.29.0
In-Reply-To: <20201023184132.3208737-1-quaresma.jose@gmail.com>
